    "title": "<p>Burden of disease and cytoreduction-requiring findings in systemic mastocytosis</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Immacolata Cozzolino",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 658.8pt; background: #daeef3; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"878\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 658.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"878\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Burden of disease findings</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 85.7pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 85.7pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 637.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 85.7pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"850\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">BM biopsy: &gt;&nbsp;30% infiltration of cellularity by MCs; serum total tryptase &gt;&nbsp;200&nbsp;ng/mL</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Signs of dysplasia or myeloproliferation (a definitive diagnosis of AHN is not possible) in non-MC lineages, with normal or only slightly abnormal blood counts</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Hepatomegaly without impairment of liver function; palpable splenomegaly without hypersplenism; lymphadenopathy on imaging or palpation</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 658.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"878\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Cytoreduction-requiring findings</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid; height: 85.7pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 85.7pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 637.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 85.7pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"850\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">BM dysfunction: cytopenia (ANC&nbsp;&lt;&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;10<sup>9</sup>/L; haemoglobin level&nbsp;&lt;&nbsp;10&nbsp;g/dL; platelet count&nbsp;&lt;&nbsp;100&nbsp;&times;&nbsp;10<sup>9</sup>/L)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Palpable hepatomegaly with impairment of liver function, ascites, and/or portal hypertension</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Osteolytic lesion with or without pathological fractures without other causes</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Palpable splenomegaly with hypersplenism</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm 3pt 12pt; text-indent: -12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Malabsorption with weight loss due to gastrointestinal MC infiltrates</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">AHN, associated haematological neoplasm; ANC, absolute neutrophil count; BM, bone marrow; MC, mast cell.</span></p>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
